This licence covers the analysis code, the dashboard, the API and the documents in
this repository. It does not cover the satellite data they read, which carries its
own terms:

  Copernicus Sentinel-2 L2A — © European Union, Copernicus Sentinel data.
    Free and open under the Copernicus Data Licence.
    Accessed through Element 84 Earth Search and Microsoft Planetary Computer.

  NASA EMIT L2A Reflectance (EMITL2ARFL) — NASA Jet Propulsion Laboratory.
    Open, requires a free NASA Earthdata login. Distributed by NASA LP DAAC.

No credentials, keys or restricted imagery are stored in this repository.
